<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: A talented and epicurious provisioner of all things sweet. Capable of deftly altering any variety of meal into a most tantalizing dessert. Remarkably swift at cooking regardless of meal type.\n\n<color=#E5E54C>Stats:</color>\n - The pâtissier receives a +20% Cooking speed bonus.-->
  <VME_IdeoRole_Patissier.description>一位天赋异禀且喜好寻欢作乐的甜点师，能够熟练地将各种食物转化成美味诱人的甜点。不论是什么菜式，他都能烹饪得非常迅速。\n\n&lt;color=#E5E54C&gt;状态：&lt;/color&gt;\n - 甜点师的烹饪速度+20%。</VME_IdeoRole_Patissier.description>
  <!--EN: pâtissier-->
  <VME_IdeoRole_Patissier.label>甜点师</VME_IdeoRole_Patissier.label>
  <!--EN: Desserts and treats shouldn’t be withheld, sugary confections should be eaten at least every couple days.\n\n<color=#E5E54C>Gameplay effect:</color>\n - Bear in mind this precept has a minimum expectation required. Moderate expectations or higher are needed for the "Desserts" need to show up.\n\n - Desserts that increase the need: Chocolate (15%), Simple dessert (30%), Fine dessert (40%), Lavish dessert (50%), Gourmet dessert (75%)-->
  <VME_Sweets_Craved.description>我们不该拒绝美味甜点的盛情款待，至少每隔几天就该享用一次。</VME_Sweets_Craved.description>
  <!--EN: craved-->
  <VME_Sweets_Craved.label>渴望</VME_Sweets_Craved.label>
  <!--EN: Sweets aren’t that great, they can easily be left behind.-->
  <VME_Sweets_Impartial.description>甜点没有想象中的那么好吃，它们的味道很容易被遗忘。</VME_Sweets_Impartial.description>
  <!--EN: impartial-->
  <VME_Sweets_Impartial.label>中立</VME_Sweets_Impartial.label>
</LanguageData>
